  "full_text": "So what's my agenda? Okay, Charlemagne was the greatest European in history. I would try to outdo Charlemagne. My goal, somebody said, oh, North Korea. No, that is not my focus. My focus is on restoring Roman Catholicism to the world as the obvious truth. There was no question at the time of the Roman Empire. Who dominated the world? Okay, might comes from truth. And might makes right. One of the fundamentals of Catholicism is all authority comes from God. All random numbers come from God. I can prove it. Pick your favorite random number. Do an offering. The goal is do heavy lifting to entertain God, to please God. And you will see an oracle when you pick a random number and use it to... pick a verse in scripture or something. So my goal, my focus, somebody thinks I'm focused on North Korea. No, that's the last thing I care about. They don't matter. Why would I care about North Korea? What I have to do is save the soul of the world, which needs to realize that they need to be, everybody is now a pious Roman Catholic, just like Charlemagne, okay? So that is my agenda. So you need to joyfully and piously study the catechism. of old-school Catholicism, like start before 400 A.D., you know, like when we slaughtered the New World. We said, we will save your souls, you pathetic heathens. And this is when we were not ashamed. Are you fucking kidding me? Are you fucking kidding me? Okay, so.",
